# Merge requires an approving review from the matching owners (enable "Require review from Code Owners"
# in branch protection for main). Replace YOUR-ORG and the team names with real ones.

# Default: any submission needs one registry maintainer.
*                          @YOUR-ORG/skill-registry-maintainers

# Platform reviewers: people who understand each platform's permissions model.
/claude/                   @YOUR-ORG/claude-skill-reviewers
/gemini/                   @YOUR-ORG/gemini-skill-reviewers
/slack/                    @YOUR-ORG/slackbot-skill-reviewers

# Anything that executes code or reaches outside the model always needs the security group.
**/scripts/                @YOUR-ORG/skill-security-reviewers
**/hooks/                  @YOUR-ORG/skill-security-reviewers
**/.mcp.json               @YOUR-ORG/skill-security-reviewers
/slack/**/manifest.json    @YOUR-ORG/skill-security-reviewers

# Changes to the review process itself.
/scripts/                  @YOUR-ORG/skill-registry-maintainers @YOUR-ORG/skill-security-reviewers
/.github/                  @YOUR-ORG/skill-registry-maintainers @YOUR-ORG/skill-security-reviewers
